slide('checks','Check the account and the explanation separately.','<ScoringPaths />','The state scorer reads the account after execution and checks facts such as payment identity, refund amount, and duplicate effects. The LLM judge reads the request, actions, and final reply to assess whether the explanation is supported. These can disagree: an agent may do the right work and describe it incorrectly. An unavailable judge response stays missing.')
